■ NEW UPDATE!    v1.8.5

► Divine powers. Build faith with your church, priests and devout villagers, then call down rain (snow in winter), lightning or healing from the new Powers page in the build menu. Lightning can set trees and buildings on fire, and rain puts the fire out.
► More hands-on fun. Throw boulders at raiders, smash the raid camp's tents to weaken or cancel the attack, and watch out for thieves sneaking into town.
► Villagers grow old and pass away. You can pick up graves and move them.
► Bigger towns. The population cap is now 100, up from 50.
► Seasons. Crops stop growing in winter and start again in spring.
► Raids. Raiders spread out instead of bunching up, and giants move faster and get knocked back properly.
► Fixes and performance. Better performance on Quest, buttons no longer trigger twice, farm animals come back after loading a save, and the priest's boat and the quest panel work properly again.

► Throw raiders across the map! Villagers react to how you treat them, fallen heroes get gravestones, raiders set up camp before attacking, and new events include a lost child, wolves and bumper harvests;
► Water look more natural;
► Your villagers and soldiers have personalities:
� Traits. Every villager is now Hardworking, Lazy, Strong, Drunkard, Devout, Brave, Cheerful or Grumpy, which changes how they work and what makes them happy.
� Thoughts. Hold a villager close to your face to hear what's on their mind.
� Veterans. Soldiers now have names and earn promotion to Veteran and Hero for kills and raids survived, getting stronger each time.

► Merchant caravan - Will provide deals for resources *Marketplace building needed;
► Trees/bushes - New section added in the building menu - now players can plant their own trees;
► Walls & Gates - added(wooden and stone walls + gates);
► 25 of villagers new quests added - Your kingdom need you!
► The PLAGUE - Sickness can break out in your village;

► HUGE UPDATE: Seasons have been added. New mechanics and beautiful visuals every season. The winters is coming, you need to prepare!

► Random CHESTS appear on the map (random between resources, happiness or can spawn enemies);
► New kind of tree added(Pine tree);
► Villagers visuals improved (hands added, new animations, new mechanics);
► Happiness system improved. New mechanics(working rate is affected; riots; population decreasing/leaving and not spawning; chance for villagers to become enemies; increase happiness by organising festivals at Tavern; and more);
► RAY INTERACTION option is now available. Now you can use HANDS INTERACTION or RAY INTERACTION for everything;
► Mushrooms (can be picked by player and added to Granary or Storehouse) & Fruit bushes added (Fruits);
► New tree type: Dead tree;
► Improved graphics, trees wind movement, terrain multi textures; Shores around the water have been redesigned;
► Paths & Trails have been added! - villagers generate dirt trails;
► Church & Priest added, improving town happiness;
► Snap Rotation option added for turning and locomotion;
► Option to set the ground/map higher or lower - added;
► Language localization added – now supports 36 languages;
► Villager Quests are now available! Villagers will come to you for help;
► Improved Building Menu mechanics;
► Fixed an issue that sometimes prevented villagers from working;
► Wood logs no longer fall onto stones, allowing villagers to gather them correctly;
► Various bug fixes and performance improvements.

Enjoy, and thank you for your support!

